{"speciesId":699,"names":{"fr":"Dragmara","es":"Aurorus","en":"Aurorus","ja":"アマルルガ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les cristaux qui parsèment son corps lui permettent de piéger ses ennemis dans la glace en émettant de l’air refroidi à -150 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Expulsa un gas gélido a temperaturas inferiores a los -150 ºC a través de sus cristales romboides y congela así a su enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The diamond-shaped crystals on its body expel air as cold as -240 degrees Fahrenheit, surrounding its enemies and encasing them in ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"マイナス１５０度の 冷気を ひし形の 結晶から 出して 敵を 包み 氷漬けにする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"En utilisant ses cristaux, il peut créer en un instant un mur de glace pour se protéger des attaques ennemies."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Gracias a sus cristales con forma de rombo, puede crear al momento una barrera de hielo para bloquear el ataque de su enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Using its diamond-shaped crystals, it can instantly create a wall of ice to block an opponent’s attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ひし形の 結晶で 氷の 壁を 瞬間的に 作り 敵の 攻撃を 防ぐのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les cristaux qui parsèment son corps lui permettent de piéger ses ennemis dans la glace en émettant de l’air refroidi à -150 °C."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Expulsa un gas gélido a temperaturas inferiores a los -150 °C a través de sus cristales romboides y congela así a su enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The diamond-shaped crystals on its body expel air as cold as -240 degrees Fahrenheit, surrounding its enemies and encasing them in ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"マイナス１５０度の 冷気を ひし形の 結晶から 出して 敵を 包み 氷漬けにする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"En utilisant ses cristaux, il peut créer en un instant un mur de glace pour se protéger des attaques ennemies."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Gracias a sus cristales con forma de rombo, puede crear al momento una barrera de hielo para bloquear el ataque de su enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Using its diamond-shaped crystals, it can instantly create a wall of ice to block an opponent’s attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ひし形の 結晶で 氷の 壁を 瞬間的に 作り 敵の 攻撃を 防ぐのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Un Dragmara a été retrouvé dans un glacier, en parfait état de conservation, ce qui a fait la une des actualités."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"El descubrimiento de un Aurorus en perfecto estado de conservación en el interior de un iceberg se convirtió en noticia."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"An Aurorus was found frozen solid within a glacier, just as it appeared long ago, which became quite a big event in the news."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"氷山の 中に 当時のままの 姿で 氷漬けに なった アマルルガが 見つかり ニュースに。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La température de la surface de son corps est de -150 °C. Ce Pokémon est généralement très calme et très doux."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La superficie de su cuerpo se mantiene a una temperatura de -150 ºC. Por lo general, es un Pokémon muy dócil y afable."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This usually quiet and kindly Pokémon has a surface temperature of around –240 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"身体の 表面の 温度は マイナス １５０度。 普段は とても大人しく やさしいポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon a été ressuscité à partir d’un fossile. On raconte qu’une aurore boréale apparaît dans le ciel nocturne quand il hurle à la lune."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Fue regenerado a partir de un fósil. Dicen que el rugido de Aurorus hace aparecer la aurora boreal en el cielo nocturno."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Aurorus was restored from a fossil. It’s said that when this Pokémon howls, auroras appear in the night sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"化石から 復元された。 アマルルガが 吠えると 夜空に オーロラが 現れると いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Lorsqu’il se laisse emporter par sa rage, il relâche des bourrasques glacées qui gèlent tout ce qui l’entoure."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando se deja llevar por la ira, emite un vaho extremadamente gélido que lo congela todo a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"When gripped by rage, Aurorus will emanate freezing air, covering everything around it in ice."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"激しい 怒りに かられると 猛烈な 冷気を 噴き出して あたり一面を 氷漬けにする。"}],"varieties":[{"id":699,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[15,"level-up",18],[16,"level-up",18],[17,"level-up",18],[18,"level-up",18],[20,"level-up",20]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[15,"level-up",56],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",56],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",56],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",56],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",42],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[15,"level-up",74],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",74],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",74],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",74],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",60],[20,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"aurora-beam","learns":[[15,"level-up",20],[16,"level-up",20],[17,"level-up",20],[18,"level-up",20],[20,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[15,"level-up",63],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",63],[16,"machine",0]